  "text": "An ingredient that helps bread dough rise.\n\nPutting one thing in the place of another.\n\nThe short, thick digit beside the fingers.\n\nA request for someone to come to an event.\n\nAn intended result that has been achieved.\n\nAn image showing a person, place or event.\n\nLook at written words and understand them.\n\nMade repeated small, light tapping sounds.\n\nInside something, or moving to its inside.\n\nShort written messages or sounds in music.\n\nBrings an earlier experience back to mind.\n\nA large strong bag used to hold materials.\n\nFound out or came to understand something.\n\nPip puts the seed in Grandma’s small boat.\n\nBe the right size or position for a place.\n\nThe two wooden bridge sections are joined.\n\nMove a picture to try a different telling.\n\nWent to get something and brought it back.\n\nA fitted opening that holds another part.\n\nContinuing to hold, have or do something.\n\nA pleased expression made with the mouth.\n\nGo and get something, then bring it back.\n\nCompleting something you have been doing.\n\nPip reads Mara’s page while Mara listens.\n\nIn the middle of, or as part of, a group.\n\nThe boy keeps his sister’s original bird.\n\nThe tape is in Mara’s office. Pick it up.\n\nFollowing something to catch or reach it.\n\nBring Pip beside the bridge pieces first.\n\nA surface on which pictures can be shown.\n\nCreates something or causes it to happen.\n\nWant something to happen or be different.\n\nComes together with someone or something.\n\nReceive, reach, or move into a new state.\n\nGiven a label or sign that identifies it.\n\nSoft pads used to make seats comfortable.\n\nSomething that really happened or exists.\n\nThe downward force of a person or object.\n\nMaking something work again after damage.\n\nFelt the absence of someone or something.\n\nCombine ingredients so they are together.",
